0.01, 0.02, , 250.0, 0.05
** Cut-backs of 0.5 and increases of 2.0 keep the increment a binary fraction of dt,
** so it returns to the aligned value
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=TIME INCREMENTATION
14, 16, 9, 25, 18, 7, ,
0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, , , 2.0,
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=LINE SEARCH
5, 1.0, 0.25, 0.25, 0.10
** Heat source on the hex weld zone and the filler (the source ends at z = 20, inside it)
*DFLUX, OP=NEW
HEAT_ZONE, BFNU, 1.0
** Convection 21 W/m2.K and radiation on the free faces; weld top emissivity 0.8 (molten,
** oxidised), elsewhere 0.6; the closed gas escape groove (GROOVE) is adiabatic
*SFILM, OP=NEW
WELD_TOP, F, 25.0, 0.021
CROWN_FREE, F, 25.0, 0.021
CARRIER_FREE, F, 25.0, 0.021
*SRADIATE, OP=NEW
